   "description": "Manage tags on applications, databases and services. Tags group resources across projects, and `deploy` accepts a tag name \u2014 so tag several resources, then deploy them together with one `deploy` call. action=list with no resource/uuid returns every tag on the CURRENT TEAM (tokens are team-scoped, so a tag on another team will not appear); with resource+uuid it returns that resource's tags. attach is ADDITIVE \u2014 it adds the named tags and leaves existing ones in place, creating any that do not exist yet \u2014 and returns the resource's full tag set afterwards. detach unlinks one tag, and Coolify deletes the tag itself once no resources carry it, so misspelled names do not accumulate. Requires Coolify v4.2+.",
